## Objective

The objective of Day 9 was to learn passive reconnaissance techniques using **LeakIX** and **Maltego**. The tasks focused on collecting publicly available information about a target domain, including subdomains, DNS records, mail servers, IP addresses, and other metadata without performing any unauthorized interaction.

